  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> 安全高效地实现目标 </h1>",
      "body": "<p><strong>借助ZOLLER »powerShrink«，热缩刀具可快速投入使用：这得益于操作直观的»pilot«软件、智能感应系统以及对各工序的持续监控。</strong></p> <p>»powerShrink«技术确保最短的工艺周期。经过短暂培训后，即使经验不足的操作员也能轻松实现由此带来的短工艺时间。»pilot«操作软件引导您完成所有工作步骤，并全自动控制多项流程。 该软件会显示每个工作步骤所需的组件，并通过屏幕上的图形显示以及 ZOLLER 开创性的 »actbyLight« 操作理念为您提供可视化支持。这种光控操作引导确保您安全、高效地使用 »powerShrink«。</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "center",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c1145",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "none",
       "after": "none"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "slider",
      "header": "",
      "slides": [
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/c/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_01_1d67bafda1.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>安装热缩套筒，选择加热参数（手动/通过 »»idChip«« 自动）</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/2/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_02_7fbe9ad14e.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>屏蔽系统：安装并对准挡板或»»varOct««（手动/电动）</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/3/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_03_59a29571d3.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>将线轴向下移动至收缩夹头处</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/2/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_04_d1d6b10cb5.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>开始加热过程，加热进度将在软件中显示</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/4/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_05_6a89d57efc.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>预热完成后，升起线圈，将切割刀具装入收缩卡盘</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/1/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_06_c67d071d45.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>将收纳罐推入绿色闪烁的冷却罩内，然后盖上</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/c/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_07_243a8d8b98.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>制冷过程自动启动，结束时会显示蓝色闪烁提示</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/8/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_08_eaa3a6241a.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>冷却过程结束后，将冷却罩从收缩夹头中取下</p>"
       }
      ],
